      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This theory leans into behavioral profiling, where algorithms seek to maintain predictable group dynamics. If your unique style of contribution statistically falls outside the established norm for those specific niche groups, the moderation system might categorize it as disruptive \"noise.\" In essence, the AI might be designed to filter out deviations, which, to the algorithm, translates to silencing an anomaly to preserve the perceived stability of the established community culture.",
